{"id":"n58465-1-7","stage":2,"title":"버튼 · 按钮","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58465-1-7-1","ko":"이 오디오는 재생 버튼이 어떤 거야?","zh":"这台音响哪个是播放键？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오디오는","meaning":"音响","explanation":"오디오：音响；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오디오","audio":"/audio/2059709cfa9795878f21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68307","senseId":"2","lemma":"오디오","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"재생","meaning":"播放","explanation":"재생：播放","readings":[{"term":"재생","audio":"/audio/d43a776c5e289f2a44c2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24927","senseId":"3","lemma":"재생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"버튼이","meaning":"按钮","explanation":"버튼：按钮；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"버튼","audio":"/audio/605632038f49400b72d7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58465","senseId":"1","lemma":"버튼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"那个","explanation":"거：那个；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66342","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"2059709cfa979587","term":"오디오","zh":"音响","audio":"/audio/2059709cfa9795878f21.mp3","entryId":"68307","definition":"为更有效地听音乐等的装置。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"d43a776c5e289f2a","term":"재생","zh":"播放","audio":"/audio/d43